Completion expanding 1 line into 3 lines of implementation via the completion action.
row: 2
col: 4
viewportTop: 1
viewportBottom: 20
-- buffer.txt --
def main():
    pass

main()
-- steps --
respond 2-2
  | "    x = 10"
  | "    y = 20"
  | "    print(x + y)"
request-completion manual
expect shown requests=1
  display:
    | modification 2 replace_chars
    | addition 3 x2
accept
expect hidden target=none
  buffer:
    | "def main():"
    | "    x = 10"
    | "    y = 20"
    | "    print(x + y)"
    | ""
    | "main()"
